OL,3,GNEWSADumping donkey in road 'cruel and
OL,4,Adangerous'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sanctuary has made a plea after "yet
OL,7,Fanother" donkey was abandoned in a
OL,8,Froad, describing it as "cruel and
OL,9,Fdangerous".
OL,11,FBarnhill Donkeys Retreat said it found
OL,12,Fa young donkey who was "so terrified it
OL,13,Fwas blindly running up and down the
OL,14,Froad" after being dumped near its site
OL,15,Fat Sleagill, near Shap, on Sunday
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,18,FLinda Gilbert said "she felt like
OL,19,Fcrying" because she could see the fear
OL,20,Fin the animal, now named Doris, who was
OL,21,F"emaciated, thin and matted" and was
OL,22,Fone of the "saddest-looking donkeys".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
