OL,3,GNEWSADumping donkey in road 'cruel and
OL,4,Adangerous'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGilbert said there had been 12 donkeys
OL,7,Fdumped in the road in the past year,
OL,8,Fwith her fearing it would cause a
OL,9,Fcrash.
